  "helpTopicPhotosStep2": "Put the product on a plain cloth, with nothing else around it",
  "helpTopicPhotosStep3": "Hold the phone still with both hands until the picture is taken",
  "helpTopicPhotosStep4": "Take one from close up, so the work can be seen",
  "helpTopicPhotosStep5": "Put your hand beside it in one photo, so the size shows",
  "helpTopicVoice": "What to say about your product",
  "helpTopicVoiceBody": "Speak the way you would to a customer standing in front of you. There is no wrong way to say it.",
  "helpTopicVoiceStep1": "Say what it is",
  "helpTopicVoiceStep2": "Say what it is made of",
  "helpTopicVoiceStep3": "Say how big it is, in inches or feet",
  "helpTopicVoiceStep4": "Say how long it took you to make",
  "helpTopicVoiceStep5": "Say what you want for it",
  "helpTopicPrice": "Setting a price",
  "helpTopicPriceBody": "Your price has to cover what the materials cost and what your time is worth. We work that out with you and never let you go under it without saying so.",
  "helpTopicPriceStep1": "Count what the materials cost you",
  "helpTopicPriceStep2": "Count how many days the work took",
  "helpTopicPriceStep3": "Look at what we suggest, and change it if you know better",
  "helpTopicPriceStep4": "If it is below your cost, we will tell you, but the choice stays yours",
  "helpTopicSold": "What happens after something sells",
  "helpTopicSoldBody": "The buyer pays on the marketplace. You pack it and hand it over, and the money comes to you.",
  "helpTopicSoldStep1": "We tell you as soon as it sells",
  "helpTopicSoldStep2": "Open it to see what to pack and how many",
  "helpTopicSoldStep3": "Pack it before the date we show you",
  "helpTopicSoldStep4": "Hand it to the person who comes to collect it",
  "helpTopicSoldStep5": "The money reaches you after that",
  "helpVideoComing": "A short video for this is on the way.",
  "helpPractice": "How to take a good photo",
  "helpPracticeBody": "A good photo and a bad one of the same pot.",
